  "description": "Ye-Dam’s built up the courage to finally ask out his longtime crush… This is it, here goes nothing… Huh?! Lee Jane misunderstands and thinks Ye-Dam’s crush is actually…a guy?! No, Ye-Dam likes you, stupid! Thus begins the world’s cutest story of miscommunication. Well, it’s probably not so cute for Ye-Dam, just how is he going to get this stupid cupid to aim at the one he actually desires…?\n\n(Souce: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 1 extra chapter.*",
